<title>CANADA: Precision Drilling sets C$200 mln bond due 2007.</title>
<headline>Precision Drilling sets C$200 mln bond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Drilling Corp on Friday set C$200 million of 6.85 percent unsecured debentures due June 26, 2007 in financial markets, said lead manager RBC Dominion Securities Inc.</p>
<p>The bond was priced at 99.90 to yield 6.864 percent, 75 basis points over the Government of Canada's 7.25 percent bond due June 1, 2007.  </p>
<p>The new issue will settle on June 26, 1997. Other members of the dealer group include Goldman Sachs Canada and TD Securities Inc.</p>
<p>((Jeffrey Hodgson (416) 941-8105, e-mail: jeffrey.hodgson@reuters.com))</p>
